Find the circumference of the circle, correct to 3 decimal places.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\draw[black,thick] (0,0) circle (1.5);
\fill[black] (0,0) circle (1.5pt);
\draw[black] (-1.5,0)--(1.5,0);
\path (0,-0.25) node[below,text=black] {$6\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Find the circumference of the circle, correct to 3 decimal places.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\draw[black,thick] (0,0) circle (1.5);
\fill[black] (0,0) circle (1.5pt);
\draw[black] (0,0)--(0:1.5);
\path (0.75,0.15) node[above,text=black] {$3.2\text{ m}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
